# Optional. Raises the Hiro API rate limit above the unauthenticated tier (50 requests/min
# per IP). Get a free key at https://platform.hiro.so.
#
# WARNING: any VITE_ variable is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle, so this key is
# readable by anyone who opens the site. Use a key dedicated to this frontend, never the
# DeepStack agent's own key, and check that its quota is not shared with the agent's.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in there; never commit a real value.
VITE_HIRO_API_KEY=
